#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Owns the one gate this process has that the paper process does not — the profile check — so nothing with a math kind, a lean field or a .lean sibling reaches Task_Validate or Task_Render pretending to be document content; everything downstream of Gateway_ProfileClean assumes that profile."
msgstr ""

